x87 host-double fast paths in softfloat, and MMX enter tracking (Android 6dada66f).
With x87 precision control at double, add/sub/mul of operands that fit a double,
and conversions that cannot round, run on the host FPU; inexact stays exact.
gen_enter_mmx is emitted once per run of consecutive MMX instructions.

diff --git a/fpu/softfloat.c b/fpu/softfloat.c
